Package: stabilitest.viz
Title: Interactive Companion App for the 'stabilitest' Package
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Marius", "Ardelean", email = "marally@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A 'shiny' application that explores the robustness and fragility
    of statistical test conclusions computed by the 'stabilitest' package.
    The app never re-implements statistics: every number comes from
    'stabilitest' functions.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/ma-brain/stabilitest.viz
BugReports: https://github.com/ma-brain/stabilitest.viz/issues
